WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:14.232
It was a boring day.

2
00:00:14.233 --> 00:00:20.601
"Let's clean the barn!" Cow said.

3
00:00:20.602 --> 00:00:26.558
"Clean the barn?" said Bat.

4
00:00:26.559 --> 00:00:30.526
"Clean the barn?" said Dog.

5
00:00:30.527 --> 00:00:32.978
"Yes!" said Cow.

6
00:00:32.979 --> 00:00:37.824
"We can scrub the walls.

7
00:00:37.825 --> 00:00:41.899
We can sweep the floor.

8
00:00:41.900 --> 00:00:49.721
We can wash the table," said Cow.

9
00:00:49.722 --> 00:00:57.157
"Then we can have a party!"

10
00:00:57.158 --> 00:01:08.245
"Who will help me?" asked Cow.

11
00:01:08.246 --> 00:01:11.422
"Who will help me clean the barn?"

12
00:01:11.423 --> 00:01:16.052
"I will help you later," said Bat.

13
00:01:16.053 --> 00:01:21.819
"I want to look for bugs now."

14
00:01:21.820 --> 00:01:26.274
"I will help you later," said Cat.

15
00:01:26.275 --> 00:01:32.618
"I want to take a nap now."

16
00:01:32.619 --> 00:01:38.786
"I will help you later," said Dog.

17
00:01:38.787 --> 00:01:45.492
"I want to dig up bones now."

18
00:01:45.493 --> 00:01:53.432
Only one friend was left.

19
00:01:53.433 --> 00:01:57.859
"Will you help me, Pig?" asked Cow.

20
00:01:57.860 --> 00:02:03.058
"Sorry, Cow," said Pig.

21
00:02:03.059 --> 00:02:05.335
"I don't like cleaning.

22
00:02:05.336 --> 00:02:17.312
I only like eating!"

